 *
 * Flat arrays, not structs-of-arrays: a struct with a uint[3] member lays out
 * identically in OpenCL C and Metal only by accident, and the expansion table
 * is read by index arithmetic anyway.  Flattening removes the question.
 *
 * Address space is spelled CL_CONSTANT so one generated file serves OpenCL
 * (__constant) and Metal (constant).  The fallback below makes the file
