 * before including this, so the guard makes the two uses agree instead of
 * making one of them depend on the other.  An earlier revision only PROMISED
 * this in the comment and did not emit it, and the JIT then failed with
 * `CL_CONSTANT uint u32_marks[580] = {` echoed back as a syntax error.
